msgid "Crash Check"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/crash_check.rst:7
#: b960465c910c42d29d532664ae119637
msgid "Sub includes a crash check which can disarm the motors in cases where the vehicle is likely out of control and has hit something.  This reduces damage to the vehicle and its surroundings, and also reduces the chance of injury to people or creatures nearby."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/crash_check.rst:10
#: 52d54776e50a4a829a91903f4828500c
msgid "When will the crash check disarm the motors?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/crash_check.rst:11
#: 6cd21c4c6473434a8bc34c888d996e4f
msgid "When all the following are true for 2 full seconds:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/crash_check.rst:13
#: f949977610634a1fa0609e43be766744
msgid "The :ref:`FS_CRASH_CHECK<FS_CRASH_CHECK>` = 2 ( A value of \"0\" disables the check while \"1\" will send only a warning to the GCS)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/crash_check.rst:14
#: 4cec0dae677c45de8dc56c788dcb5910
msgid "The vehicle is armed"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/crash_check.rst:15
#: 91df3cc30f374b3498c2d8e7c3d4b948
